dsh-desktop-guard
=================

This package is a fork of qingying012/dsh-desktop-control v0.1.3
(https://github.com/qingying012/dsh-desktop-control), licensed under the MIT
License. The original copyright notice is retained in LICENSE.

Fork changes (dsh-desktop-guard):
  * dsh/policy.js: content policy enforced in Node before PowerShell runs
    (dangerous labels, sensitive windows, credential payloads, denied keys,
    sequence recursion and depth limit).
  * assets/gui.ps1: `type -verify` focuses/readback verification and refusal when
    the focused control provably is not editable; `click -verify` hit-tests the
    point against the named window and reports the focused control; `find`
    gained `-exact`, `-index` and refuses ambiguous clicks.
  * dsh/index.js: policy wiring, verify/exact/index parameters, structured
    verification results.
  * New README sections and tests.

The upstream project and this fork are independent of DeepSeek. "DeepSeek
Harness" is the host application both target.
